{
    "chapter_num": 2,
    "verses_count": 25,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Our Inheritance Through Christ’s Blood"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, laying aside all malice, all deceit, hypocrisy, envy, and all evil speaking, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "as newborn babes, desire the pure milk of the word, that you may grow "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU adds up to salvation"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "thereby, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "if indeed you have tasted that the Lord "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " gracious."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Chosen Stone and His Chosen People"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Coming to Him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a living stone, rejected indeed by men, but chosen by God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " precious, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "you also, as living stones, are being built up a spiritual house, a holy priesthood, to offer up spiritual sacrifices acceptable to God through Jesus Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore it is also contained in the Scripture,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Behold, I lay in Zion"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "A chief cornerstone, elect, precious,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And he who believes on Him will by no means be put to shame.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, to you who believe, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "He is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " precious; but to those who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU disbelieve"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "are disobedient,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“The stone which the builders rejected"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Has become the chief cornerstone,”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“A stone of stumbling"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And a rock of offense.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "They stumble, being disobedient to the word, to which they also were appointed."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a chosen generation, a royal priesthood, a holy nation, His own special people, that you may proclaim the praises of Him who called you out of darkness into His marvelous light; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who once "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not a people but "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " now the people of God, who had not obtained mercy but now have obtained mercy."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Living Before the World"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beloved, I beg "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as sojourners and pilgrims, abstain from fleshly lusts which war against the soul, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "having your conduct honorable among the Gentiles, that when they speak against you as evildoers, they may, by "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " good works which they observe, glorify God in the day of visitation."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Submission to Government"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore submit yourselves to every "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "institution"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "ordinance of man for the Lord’s sake, whether to the king as supreme, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "or to governors, as to those who are sent by him for the punishment of evildoers and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "for the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " praise of those who do good. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For this is the will of God, that by doing good you may put to silence the ignorance of foolish men— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "as free, yet not using liberty as a cloak for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "wickedness"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "vice, but as bondservants of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Honor all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "people."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Love the brotherhood. Fear God. Honor the king."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Submission to Masters"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Servants, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " submissive to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " masters with all fear, not only to the good and gentle, but also to the harsh. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " commendable, if because of conscience toward God one endures grief, suffering wrongfully. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For what credit "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " if, when you are beaten for your faults, you take it patiently? But when you do good and suffer, if you take it patiently, this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " commendable before God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For to this you were called, because Christ also suffered for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "us, leaving "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "us an example, that you should follow His steps:"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Who"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "committed no sin,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Nor was deceit found in His mouth”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ";"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who, when He was reviled, did not revile in return; when He suffered, He did not threaten, but committed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Himself"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to Him who judges righteously; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who Himself bore our sins in His own body on the tree, that we, having died to sins, might live for righteousness—by whose "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "wounds"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "stripes you were healed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For you were like sheep going astray, but have now returned to the Shepherd and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gr. Episkopos"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Overseer of your souls."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}